ny explanations or comments outside of the YAML, as per the user\'s instructions. Only the complete YAML playbook should be outputted, starting with \'---\' followed by the tasks.\n\nPutting it all together, I\'ll list each task in the order specified, using the correct module names and arguments. I\'ll double-check each task to make sure it\'s correctly formatted and adheres to the user\'s requirements.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Disable swap\n  swap:\n    name: swap\n    state: disabled\n\n- name: Disable core dumps\n  sysctl:\n    name: kernel.coredump_max\n    value: 0\n    sysctl_file: /etc/sysctl.conf\n\n- name: Disable Shell Command History\n  shell: \n    cmd: echo -e "[ Cage ]\\nexport HISTCONTROL=ignoreboth\\nclear" >> /etc/profile\n  file:\n    path: /etc/profile\n    state: touch\n    mode: \'0755\'\n  shell: \n    cmd: echo -e "[ Cage ]\\nexport HISTCONTROL=ignoreboth\\nclear" >> /etc/bashrc\n  file:\n    path: /etc/bashrc\n    state: touch\n    mode: \'0755\'\n  shell:\n    cmd: history -c\n  file:\n    path: ~/.bash_history\n    state: file\n    force: yes\n    content: \'\'\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-22T07:35:15.060119113Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 11041225829, 'load_duration': 102427721, 'prompt_eval_count': 293, 'prompt_eval_duration': 69814490, 'eval_count': 722, 'eval_duration': 10867619720, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--ba06d3b6-9286-4221-850a-31cf0dff0174-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 293, 'output_tokens': 722, 'total_tokens': 1015}
