th proper indentation and no trailing spaces.\n\nWait, in the original playbook, the \'when\' condition is written as \'when: rke2_kubevip_cloud_provider_enable | default(\'false\')\'. I think the correct way is to use \'default\' as a filter, so it should be \'rke2_kubevip_cloud_provider_enable | default(false)\'. But in YAML, boolean values don\'t need quotes, so I\'ll adjust that.\n\nPutting it all together, I\'ll rewrite each task with the corrected module names and parameters. I\'ll also make sure that the \'mode\' is set correctly without quotes and that the \'group\' is properly specified.\n\nI think that should address all the ansible-lint issues without changing the task functionality.\n</think>\n\n---\n- name: Create the RKE2 manifests directory\n  ansible.builtin.file:\n    path: /opt/rke2/manifests\n    state: directory\n    group: root\n    mode: 493\n\n- name: Copy kube-vip files to first server\n  ansible.builtin.copy:\n    remote_src: true\n    src: files/kube-vip/\n    dest: /opt/rke2/manifests/\n\n- name: Copy kube-vip load balancer manifests to first server\n  ansible.builtin.copy:\n    remote_src: true\n    src: files/kube-vip/loadbalancer/\n    dest: /opt/rke2/manifests/\n  when: rke2_kubevip_cloud_provider_enable | default(false)' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-22T10:29:28.77021842Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 14917923477, 'load_duration': 72673099, 'prompt_eval_count': 2041, 'prompt_eval_duration': 878209050, 'eval_count': 799, 'eval_duration': 13966288377, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--9e948530-3997-4b76-b56d-3a705d69fd80-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2041, 'output_tokens': 799, 'total_tokens': 2840}
